# tactics-smoke.epd — the committed tier-1.5 smoke suite (design/14 §3.1).
#
# 28 positions, every one machine-verified before being committed:
#   - the smoke.mate* entries are the engine's own mate suite
#     (src/search/mod.rs), verified there by exhaustive minimax over
#     python-chess movegen, and re-verified with Stockfish 16;
#   - the named-game entries were reconstructed by REPLAYING the game
#     moves through python-chess (so each FEN is provably reachable) and
#     verified with Stockfish 16 at depth 24, MultiPV 2: the bm move is
#     SF's best and either forces mate or wins by >= 2.0 over the
#     second-best move;
#   - the smoke.fork/skewer entries are hand-composed motifs that passed
#     the same Stockfish check.
# Chess positions are facts, not code (D27). Lines starting with '#' are
# comments (tools/tactics.py skips them). bm is SAN; multiple bm moves
# mean every listed move is a verified-fastest win.
#
# This suite is a SANITY harness, never a merge gate; the published WAC
# corpus is fetched (not vendored, D15) via tools/tactics.sh --fetch-wac.
6k1/5ppp/8/8/8/8/5PPP/3R2K1 w - - bm Rd8#; id "smoke.mate1.backrank"; c0 "back-rank mate";
